。方雅有父風，位正員郎。子朓。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"緯","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:m0000","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝緯。"},{"start":5,"end":12,"surface":"第五女長城公主","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:u0005","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"文帝之第五女、緯妻；本篇未具個人名。"},{"start":15,"end":16,"surface":"綜","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:m0015","person_id":"tbn_5t5_xwp","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝綜。"},{"start":17,"end":18,"surface":"約","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:m0017","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝約。"},{"start":46,"end":47,"surface":"朓","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei:p002:m0046","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝朓。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1531762,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":5866,"raw_end":5914,"raw_character_offsets":[5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,5875,5876,5877,5878,5879,5880,5881,5882,5883,5884,5885,5886,5887,5888,5889,5890,5891,5892,5893,5894,5895,5896,5897,5898,5899,5900,5901,5902,5903,5904,5905,5906,5907,5908,5909,5910,5911,5912,5913],"projection_sha256":"d56e1d7c65b17e7aace7558534f511dcaafe20eb93001d90e7ddbb70a374fa6e"},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xiezong-xiewei-ws1531762"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p006","text":"三子：綜、約、緯。綜有才藝，善隸書，為太子中舍人，與舅范曄謀反，伏誅。約亦坐死。緯尚太祖第五女長城公主，素為約所憎，免死徙廣州。孝建中，還京師。方雅有父風。太宗泰始中，至正員郎中。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p006:m0003","surface":"綜","start":3,"end":4,"person_id":"tbn_5t5_xwp","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretati